{"4927240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ruptured Floor", "steam_appid": 4927240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5023530], "detailed_description": "<h1>Devlog</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Posting news about the demo</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927240/extras/567f41248cfaffd7bc4f6b5324d7922e.poster.avif?t=1788215567\" width=1170 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927240/extras/567f41248cfaffd7bc4f6b5324d7922e.webm?t=1788215567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927240/extras/567f41248cfaffd7bc4f6b5324d7922e.mp4?t=1788215567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruptured Floor is a horror puzzle game, set in a <strong>surreal non-eucledean</strong> office space. In the office, you will find remnants of the protagonists life, desguised as employees. Not all of them are friendly, so be aware. The story unveils dark memories  uncovered and manifested through a nightmarish lens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters and other employees will <strong>chase you down</strong>. Walls and objects disappear or move when you are not looking. This place isn't kind to you but, it is your home. For now. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927240/extras/718d25fb0566db1c11799f2e00a6d0f8.poster.avif?t=1788215567\" width=1170 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927240/extras/718d25fb0566db1c11799f2e00a6d0f8.webm?t=1788215567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927240/extras/718d25fb0566db1c11799f2e00a6d0f8.mp4?t=1788215567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must escape this place. Solve <strong>cryptic puzzles</strong> to unlock the exit. The solution is known but, you must find how to input it into the different locks, either by manipulating the environment, or finding hidden objects to interact with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruptured Floor is a <strong>first person</strong> game with very minimal interactions. Looking and moving around is your main source of interaction. You are disarmed, and vulnerable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927240/extras/a9a8f294c917f7b2bfbc689c3e03313f.poster.avif?t=1788215567\" width=1170 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927240/extras/a9a8f294c917f7b2bfbc689c3e03313f.webm?t=1788215567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927240/extras/a9a8f294c917f7b2bfbc689c3e03313f.mp4?t=1788215567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level is unique, and will offer a new set of challenges, such as maze navigation, or spatial reasoning puzzles with moving objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On top of that, some riddles go a step further. You will need to find hidden clues across the whole game to find the greater mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927240/extras/567f41248cfaffd7bc4f6b5324d7922e.poster.avif?t=1788215567\" width=1170 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927240/extras/567f41248cfaffd7bc4f6b5324d7922e.webm?t=1788215567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927240/extras/567f41248cfaffd7bc4f6b5324d7922e.mp4?t=1788215567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruptured Floor is a horror puzzle game, set in a <strong>surreal non-eucledean</strong> office space. In the office, you will find remnants of the protagonists life, desguised as employees. Not all of them are friendly, so be aware. The story unveils dark memories  uncovered and manifested through a nightmarish lens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters and other employees will <strong>chase you down</strong>. Walls and objects disappear or move when you are not looking. This place isn't kind to you but, it is your home. For now. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927240/extras/718d25fb0566db1c11799f2e00a6d0f8.poster.avif?t=1788215567\" width=1170 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927240/extras/718d25fb0566db1c11799f2e00a6d0f8.webm?t=1788215567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927240/extras/718d25fb0566db1c11799f2e00a6d0f8.mp4?t=1788215567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must escape this place. Solve <strong>cryptic puzzles</strong> to unlock the exit. The solution is known but, you must find how to input it into the different locks, either by manipulating the environment, or finding hidden objects to interact with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruptured Floor is a <strong>first person</strong> game with very minimal interactions. Looking and moving around is your main source of interaction. You are disarmed, and vulnerable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927240/extras/a9a8f294c917f7b2bfbc689c3e03313f.poster.avif?t=1788215567\" width=1170 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927240/extras/a9a8f294c917f7b2bfbc689c3e03313f.webm?t=1788215567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927240/extras/a9a8f294c917f7b2bfbc689c3e03313f.mp4?t=1788215567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level is unique, and will offer a new set of challenges, such as maze navigation, or spatial reasoning puzzles with moving objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On top of that, some riddles go a step further. You will need to find hidden clues across the whole game to find the greater mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Dive into a surreal and dark office space made of distorted floors. Traverse them all, one at the time, to find an exit. Ruptured Floor is a horror puzzle game with a unique twist. Every floor requires a combination to open the door. The code is known. The lock, however, will need to be found.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<br><